.container.py-5
  .row.justify-content-center
    .col-md-6.text-center
      %i.bi.bi-check-circle-fill.text-success{ style: "font-size: 3rem;" }
      %h1.h3.mt-3 Thank You!
      %p.lead.text-muted
        Your contract for
        %strong= @work_order.title
        has been signed.
      %p.text-muted
        Reference:
        %strong= @work_order.number
      %p.mt-4.text-muted
        We'll be in touch shortly with next steps. If you have any questions, please don't hesitate to reach out.
